    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_text">No analytics, no ads, no trackers. What you type, what the keyboard learns and your clipboard stay on this phone and are excluded from backups. The internet is used only to fetch GIFs from the source you chose, when you open the GIF panel; the microphone only for voice typing.</string>
